          "headline": "San Miguel Beermen Win Back-to-Back PBA Philippine Cup Championships",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-02-01&search=San%20Miguel%20Beermen%20Win%20Back-to-Back%20PBA%20Philippine%20Cup%20Championships",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>San Miguel closed out TNT 92–77 in Game 6 at MOA Arena for a second straight Philippine Cup, the franchise's 12th All-Filipino and 31st title. June Mar Fajardo had 29 points and 23 rebounds and won Finals MVP, the first Ramon Fernandez Trophy. Sunday, February 1, had sat in no edition's window; this Saturday-ending review is the first to carry it.</p>",
