          "descriptionHtml": "<p>On the first day new complaints could be filed after the one-year bar, Makabayan and a Tindig Pilipinas–church coalition lodged two impeachment cases against Vice President Sara Duterte. Articles include confidential-fund misuse, bribery, unexplained wealth, and alleged tolerance of extrajudicial killings. House Secretary General Cheloy Garafil later confirmed both were transmitted to Speaker Bojie Dy.</p>",
